# Frontend constraints

Follow `.cursor/skills/frontend-code/SKILL.md` when editing these files.

- Nested ternaries in JSX are forbidden. Use early returns, `{cond && <X />}`, or a small component.
- `any` is forbidden (`as any` included). Narrow with a type guard or a precise type.
- No user-facing string in source. Add keys to both `en` and `pl` locale files.
- Mantine only. No Tailwind.
- `'use client'` only when the file needs state, effects, or browser events.
